        "publishTime": "2026-06-29T11:11:39.983384491Z",
        "flagContentUri": "https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId=Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tadGVsazFWV3hGZVVkdWQyeFBNVWt6UkVaR1EwRRAB&d=17924085&t=1&wv=1",
        "googleMapsUri": "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m6!14m5!1m4!2m3!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tadGVsazFWV3hGZVVkdWQyeFBNVWt6UkVaR1EwRRAB!2m1!1s0x3403ff7fc458ec37:0x513ee10bd7a2a002"
      },
      {
        "name": "places/ChIJN-xYxH__AzQRAqCi1wvhPlE/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2psb1YwMU9XbXhvYUhwd1MycFlYM2ROYnpKSVNsRRAB",
        "relativePublishTimeDescription": "7 個月前",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": {
          "text": "座落西環的 Taste All Pete，是一家只容納約十人的袖珍法式小餐館，卻散發著難以忽視的迷人氣息。餐廳以扎實的法式 bistro 手法見稱，菜單不繁，但每一道都見廚師的認真。是晚雖未嘗到名噪一時的威靈頓牛柳，卻絲毫未感失望——原隻焗龍蝦配賓尼仕汁（Béarnaise sauce）火候精準，龍蝦肉鮮甜彈牙，醬汁濃而不膩，奶香與龍蒿的清芬互相呼應；法式紙包魚（en papillote）則保留了魚肉最天然的汁液與香氣，是一道需要耐心與技巧的料理，並非每家餐廳都做得這般細緻。\n\n三黃雞一菜更叫人眼前一亮：雞卷滲著玉香與油香，皮脆肉嫩，帶出食材本身的層次，無需華麗的醬汁堆砌，足見廚師對食材的尊重與掌握。在如此親密的用餐空間裡，這份樸實而認真的料理態度，令人不禁憶起當年初訪 Bistro du Vin 時那種驚喜——是那種不靠名氣、不靠裝潢，只憑一鍋一鑊征服食客的餐廳。\n\nTucked into a quiet corner of Sai Wan, Taste All Pete seats barely ten, yet punches well above its weight. The baked whole lobster with Béarnaise and the delicate fish en papillote showcase classical French bistro techniques rarely executed with such care at this price point. The three-yellow chicken roll, fragrant with its natural oils and subtle aroma, further reveals a kitchen that lets quality ingredients speak for themselves — a quietly confident little gem reminiscent of a first visit to Bistro du Vin.",
          "languageCode": "zh-Hant"
        },
        "originalText": {
